flowchart TB
  U[Operator] -->|Geometry and schedule| P1[1 Manage sites and registry]
  P1 <--> D1[(SQLite)]
  U -->|Check now or replay dates| P2[2 Queue and schedule runs]
  D1 -->|Due active sites| P2
  P2 --> P3[3 Discover and select usable dates]
  P3 <-->|STAC and AOI SCL reads| SAT[Provider chain]
  P3 -->|Scene links and run states| D1
  P3 --> P4[4 Read aligned bands and analyse change]
  SAT -->|Cropped real bands| P4
  P4 <--> D2[(Window cache and evidence files)]
  P4 --> P5[5 Classify regions and test seasonality and authorisation]
  CTX[Optional context services] --> P5
  D1 -->|In-force zone records| P5
  P5 -->|Case, findings and reasons| D1
  P5 --> P6[6 Filter, merge and route alerts]
  P6 -->|Alert and delivery records| D1
  P6 --> DEPT[Department inbox and optional SMTP]
  D1 --> P7[7 Serve console, SSE and PDF]
  D2 --> P7
  P7 --> U
  U -->|Status and review notes| P7
  P7 --> D1
